# HUD_DrawLifeRing: the clamps no corpus frame needs (ruling 5, 2), at its first call (a6 = a
# player record). negative: health +$4 below 0 (a hit larger than what was left, before the
# death check: Player_AddStats floors it the same way). many_lives: lives +$6 at 10 (extra
# lives add to it; the digit shows at most 9).

case negative
w a6 + 4 = $FFF0

case many_lives
w a6 + 6 = 10
